       FIG. 6  is a diagram illustrating details of a gateway  14  and alternative payment systems  18  illustrated in  FIG. 1 . The gateway  14  may comprise a traditional gateway module  14 A, a gateway vault  14 B, and a high-security firewall  633 . The high-security firewall  63  provides a secure communication channel between the central mobile payment controller  50  in the gateway  14 . A traditional gateway module  14 A may comprise a credit switch  602  and a transaction transport module  604 . 
